  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **When I Paint My Masterpiece**: back after 51 archived shows (388 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **dc2023-07-07.busman.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 182 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **20230727_20230727_0431**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 18 songs; 182 min [3]\n- **deadco2023-07-07**: source not stated; 19 songs; 180 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **dc2023-07-07.busman.flac16**: taped by Doug Kalley; transferred by Doug Kalley; source: Busman BS1/K2>DR60DMKII [1]\n- **20230727_20230727_0431**: taped by John Hermsen; transferred by John Hermsen; source: 6 Channel AUD Matrix [3]. Also: John Hermsen recorded and transferred the show; Markus W. made the matrix and mastering in Dusseldorf, Germany; Three mic sources went into a Sound Devices MixPre 6: Schoeps MK5 cardioids, AKG C568EB, and Schoeps MK41 through a Baby N-Box; Taped from roughly 25 feet right of the soundboard; the six channels were matrixed after the show from audience sources [3]\n- **deadco2023-07-07**: taped by Jay; transferred by Jay; source: Schoeps CMC622 + Schoeps CMC641>Sound Devices MixPre 6ii [2]",
